  "releaseNotes": "### 14.3.10\n* Adds new property `SpreadsheetMaximumPageWidth` in GdPictureDocumentConverter.\n* Adds new property `SpreadsheetMaximumPageHeight` in GdPictureDocumentConverter.\n* Added DocuVieware support comma separated values in page range options. (J#DV-686)\n* Fixed `SystemNotImplemented` issue when calling ThumbnailEx.ThumbnailFrom[Stream|File] methods on GdPicture (net8.0-windows) (J#GDPIC-1537)\n* Improves PDF/UA conversion engine. (J#NAT-192, J#GDPIC-1535)",
